  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Spartan Weaponry 扩展工具包是一个库，让创建 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spartan Weaponry</a> 附属模组变得轻松自如。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8e635bf06a942326908c05bf879e993e7e6658b4.png\" width=\"1127\" height=\"330\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Spartan Weaponry 扩展工具包</strong> 支持仅通过指定材料即可自动注册整套武器。该工具包还负责数据生成，包括标签、物品模型和合成配方。此外，它修复了 Spartan Weaponry API 中的多项已知问题。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果您有兴趣在您的模组中使用此库，请访问 <a href=\"https://github.com/KreloX/SpartanToolkit\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 页面</a>&nbsp;（开发中）。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>使用本库的模组：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry-ice-and-fire\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spartan Weaponry: 冰与火</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry-aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spartan Weaponry: 天界</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spartan Weaponry: 暮色森林</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry-undergarden\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spartan Weaponry: 下花园</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry-blue-skies\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spartan Weaponry: 碧空</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry-simpleores\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spartan Weaponry: 简单矿石</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry-gobber\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spartan Weaponry: 戈伯</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252fkreloxkinetic\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://1drv.ms/i/c/6bf544900f9867ae/IQR3yxNMtle9S4RxniPeeGgMAVrcnQ4U65DGA1uiSdBUIbE?width=837&height=80&n=-1\" width=\"837\" height=\"80\"> </a></p>",
